{"id":"W2af5dbf20f09ceb19bd73579","zh":"域概率水平值","en":"","name":"域概率水平值","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W2af5dbf20f09ceb19bd73579","text":"域概率水平值","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sf704395e95ef21c67016","source_id":"P107","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"文献[8]提出一种危险点分布比率的方法,根据此法,本文对控制指标的二维分布进行网格划分,计算每个网格中低等级域点数Nr占网格中总点数N的比率,用Pr表示,可称为域概率水平值,计算式为 Pr=Nr/N (5) Pr代表控制指标落入此区域时,其对应的车辆系统部件动力响应指标处在此响应域的概率。","citations":[{"source_id":"P107","page":4,"page_end":4}]},{"id":"S9af206d33e19345452dc","source_id":"P107","page":4,"page_end":4,"language":"zh","text":"轨道不平顺控制指标分布子频带能量2/(10-3 mm2) 子频带能量1/(10-3 mm2) 0.5 1.0 (a)整修-恶化-保养域的域概率水平值分布子频带能量2/(10-3 mm2) 子频带能量1/(10-3 mm2) -1.0 -0.5 0.5 1.0 (b)整修域与恶化-保养域的域界线由图7可知,整修域对应的轨道不平顺控制指标基本处于2个子频带能量均较大的位置,特别是经过概率阈值处理后(图7(b)),1级整修域与其余联合域的分类更加明显,降低了分类识别的难度。","citations":[{"source_id":"P107","page":4,"page_end":4}]}],"sources":{"P107":{"id":"P107","title":"高速铁路车辆系统动力响应指标域估计及线路状态反演方法","authors":"徐磊,高建敏,翟婉明","year":"2016","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2016.05.013","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2016）","overview_slug":"2016-region-estimation-of-dynamic-response-indexes-for-high-speed-railway-vehicle-system-and-line-status"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comparisons":[],"contexts":[{"text":"网格内目标域样本占全部样本的比例，用于重新标记类别。","language":"zh","source_id":"P107","paper_slug":"2016-region-estimation-of-dynamic-response-indexes-for-high-speed-railway-vehicle-system-and-line-status","title":"高速铁路车辆系统动力响应指标域估计及线路状态反演方法","kind":"paper_usage"}],"word_links":[{"id":"Wa63a81a4efbb66cdb851174b","name":"Region probability level","language":"en","kind":"translation","label":"文献参考译法","reason":null}],"expression_links":[{"id":